@startuml
left to right direction
title DRAFT - TelecomManagement Use Cases
actor "CSKH System" as CSKH
actor "Reporting Consumer\n(caller Open)" as Reporter
rectangle TelecomManagement {
  usecase "UC01 Activate Subscriber" as U1
  usecase "UC02 Subscribe Package" as U2
  usecase "UC03 Cancel at Cycle End" as U3
  usecase "UC04 Credit Account" as U4
  usecase "UC05 Debit Account" as U5
  usecase "UC06 Query Consumption" as U6
  usecase "Lookup Available Numbers" as Lookup
  usecase "Query Activation Request" as Status
}
CSKH --> U1
CSKH --> U2
CSKH --> U3
CSKH --> U4
CSKH --> U5
CSKH --> Lookup
CSKH --> Status
Reporter --> U6
note bottom of U2
  Package activation and fee collection
  succeed together (DEC-03).
  Internal fee is not UC05 load traffic.
end note
note bottom of Lookup
  Read does not reserve a number.
end note
note right of Status
  CSKH manages requestId automatically.
  WAITING is not successful activation.
end note
note "Internal scheduled processing:\nJOB-01 Expiration\nJOB-02 Daily consumption aggregation\nUC01 recovery task is supporting processing.\nScheduler is not an external actor." as Jobs
@enduml
